# Opens the Sample gallery's blocking popup, pauses so a developer can look at it, then closes it.
#
#   pwsh -NoProfile -WorkingDirectory geodc -File dev/ui.ps1 attach --target sample --launch --passive
#   pwsh -NoProfile -WorkingDirectory geodc -File dev/ui.ps1 do --interactive --format text --file dev/ui-scripts/sample-popup-manual-check.ui
#
# With --interactive, the pause step waits in a UI driver window until you press Continue or Fail. Without it, the
# step is skipped and the script runs straight through. Works in passive mode, because the popup closes through its
# footer.
@target sample
@var check=The popup is centred over the gallery, its footer buttons line up and the backdrop dims the page.

run lib/sample-open-popup
pause --message '${check}'
run lib/sample-close-popup
